      "question": "What red flags should be monitored for in this patient?",
      "my_answer": "Respiratory muscle weakness (dyspnea, shallow breathing, low oxygen saturation), worsening bulbar symptoms (dysphagia, aspiration, nasal regurgitation), and signs of myasthenic crisis.",
